# AgentCore Runtime build context excludes (Spec 04: runtime-packaging).
# Critically: `.env` (holds the local Tavily key + AWS overrides) must never
# enter the build context / image. The real Tavily key is resolved from
# Secrets Manager at invocation time (runtime_app.py), never baked in.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.venv/
.ai_radar_cache/
.git/
.gitignore
cdk.out/
**/cdk.out/
cdk.context.json
**/cdk.context.json
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/

tests/
specs/
docs/

.pytest_cache/
.claude/
tasks/

# CDK app (not needed inside the agent container image)
infra/

README.md
CLAUDE.md
